<title>TURKEY: Turkish bourse sees up to 50,000 T cotton imports.</title>
<headline>Turkish bourse sees up to 50,000 T cotton imports.</headline>
<dateline>IZMIR, Turkey 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>An official from Turkey's leading Izmir commodity bourse said on Tuesday he expected imports of 40,000 to 50,000 tonnes of cotton in the next four months, until the new crop arrives on the market.</p>
</text>
